+one named source per file, each with its own `blob_id` and `on_success`. To
+combine them into one output, give each source's rows any per-file field the
+user asked for (for example a `value_transform` setting a literal `quarter`)
+and point every branch's `on_success` at the same sink; a `queue` fan-in must
+be consumed by a downstream node, never by a sink of the same name.
 
